## Configuration File Reference

### Parameter Categories

#### Basic Settings
- `random_seed`: Random number generator seed
- `simulation_timestep`: Simulation time step in seconds
- `neuron_count`: Total number of neurons
- `region_count`: Number of neural regions
- `connection_probability`: Probability of synaptic connections

#### Learning Parameters
- `stdp_ltp_weight`: STDP long-term potentiation weight
- `stdp_ltd_weight`: STDP long-term depression weight
- `stdp_tau`: STDP time constant in milliseconds

#### Structural Plasticity
- `synaptogenesis_rate`: Rate of new synapse formation
- `pruning_rate`: Rate of synapse elimination

#### Memory System
- `working_memory_capacity`: Maximum working memory capacity
- `max_episodes`: Maximum number of episodic memories
- `replay_interval`: Interval between memory replays
- `consolidation_interval`: Interval between memory consolidations

#### Neuromodulation
- `dopamine_level`: Dopamine system activity level
- `curiosity_drive`: Curiosity system drive strength
- `novelty_threshold`: Novelty detection threshold

#### Development
- `development_rate`: Rate of developmental changes
- `plasticity_decay`: Rate of plasticity reduction with age

#### Performance
- `replay_interval`: Frequency of memory replay
- `consolidation_interval`: Frequency of memory consolidation
- `checkpoint_enabled`: Whether checkpointing is enabled
- `checkpoint_path`: Path for checkpoint files

#### Output
- `log_level`: Logging verbosity level
- `save_stats`: Whether to save statistics
- `export_format`: Default export format

